 ## Abstract
 
-Adds a new transaction whose validity and gas payment can be defined abstractly. This is achieved by decomposing the transaction into a sequence of *frames* which are contract calls that validate the transaction, approve gas payment, and execute standard user operations.
+Adds a new transaction whose validity and gas payment can be defined abstractly. This is achieved by decomposing the transaction into a sequence of *frames* which are contract calls that validate the transaction, approve gas payment, and execute standard user operations. It also specifies guarantor payers, flexible nonces, and signer binding under a single `AUTH_MANAGER` system contract.
 
