+On successful inclusion (after the validity rule above resolves true under either branch), advance the nonce stream exactly once, regardless of sender VERIFY outcome:
+
+```python
+def consume_nonce(sender, signer, nonce):
+    if signer == 0:
+        state[sender].nonce = nonce + 1
+    else:
+        AUTH_MANAGER.advanceNonce(sender, signer, nonce)
+```
