+This is the single normative consumption point. `APPROVE` (in any scope) does not advance the nonce; pre-frame consensus only checks `tx.nonce == current_nonce(sender, signer)`. The post-inclusion advance preserves replay protection for guarantor-backed failures and for streams whose validation failed after admission, and is outside frame rollback (including atomic-batch rollback). See [Guarantors](#guarantors) and [Flexible Nonces](#flexible-nonces).
